# CR 603.6a: what sees a permanent enter is decided once everything entering
# with it has. Primeval Titan puts Simic Growth Chamber, then Yavimaya, onto
# the battlefield in one effect. Yavimaya makes every land a Forest, so
# Roiling Canopy ("whenever a Forest you control enters, if you control five
# other Forests") triggers for both: Java matches a waiting ChangesZone
# trigger after the effect (TriggerHandler.collectTriggerForWaiting), not as
# each card moves. Matched per card, Growth Chamber is no Forest yet and
# Canopy triggers once. Both pumps go on Grizzly Bears, which attacks for 8.
startturn human
advance 3
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue optionaltrigger true
queue cardchoice 81,82
tapformana human 100 G
tapformana human 101 G
tapformana human 102 G
tapformana human 103 G
tapformana human 104 G
tapformana human 107 G
# The Titan, its trigger, then both Canopy pumps on the Bears and Growth
# Chamber's return of Forest 100.
queue targets 106
queue targets 106
queue cardchoice 100
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 2
queue attackers 106
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
